{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 36","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the fraction which equals 1/4 when 3 is subtracted from the numerator, but equals 1/2 when 2 is added to the denominator.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/6/e461ec9dae192edc49f5593c9f59c7bd79995486.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad 3/4 \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad 8/5 \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad 2/3 \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad 5/8 \\quad \\text{(E) NOTA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"420\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the original fraction be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/4/3f474e51e878a3d76a638018d6c57ac787510007.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"18\" height=\"36\" /> We can write the system of equations\"\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/6/6e642015c7d4c05b49905c00dbf97fa409119744.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x-3}{y}=\\frac{1}{4}\\]\" width=\"79\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/f/dff6cf72c2b2a6f6fd701e0486152f3bc3048af5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x}{y+2}=\\frac{1}{2}\\]\" width=\"78\" height=\"40\" />\nSolving, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/b/90bc68ea123f253d1ee1e8e61c0d73c014a497de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}=\\boxed{\\text{(D)} \\quad 5/8}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"123\" height=\"36\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are asked to find a fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27f583697295fc6f723862c13228ee55107c33ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" /> such that:\n</p><p>1. Subtracting 3 from the numerator gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c339afa03e060d959e4942be7522c0c992f4c41c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/2/e023acca6916392b5921ed22e36679ab3fd21480.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{m-3}{n} = \\frac{1}{4}\\]\" width=\"85\" height=\"37\" />\n2. Adding 2 to the denominator gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3adf7076994f1b2be3fc3acfcdb8f03d6298dd24.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{m}{n+2} = \\frac{1}{2}\\]\" width=\"80\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 1: Check option (A) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>- Subtract 3 from numerator:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e392237ea3b05ae2f50969c403be7a647848677a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{3-3}{4} = \\frac{0}{4} = 0 \\neq \\frac{1}{4} \\quad \\text{(fails)}\\]\" width=\"207\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>- Add 2 to denominator:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/7/9a72df8041d0710a03df7f98c4d5924617e8a6af.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{3}{4+2} = \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{1}{2} \\quad \\text{(works)}\\]\" width=\"187\" height=\"38\" />\n→ Does not satisfy both conditions.\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 2: Check option (B) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/8/778abab8ebf560b512a9a7e95a1c404065dc9cb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>- Subtract 3 from numerator:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/4/7a45c51344fb13c7a91cdc934775c28ccd8cc804.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{8-3}{5} = \\frac{5}{5} = 1 \\neq \\frac{1}{4} \\quad \\text{(fails)}\\]\" width=\"207\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>- Add 2 to denominator:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/f/80f297e7156745368597e8432ce11965baae52c7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{8}{5+2} = \\frac{8}{7} \\neq \\frac{1}{2} \\quad \\text{(fails)}\\]\" width=\"174\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>→ Does not satisfy both conditions.\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 3: Check option (C) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>- Subtract 3 from numerator:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/c/e5cfadc09b383ba565f65348077987aa9776fca4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2-3}{3} = \\frac{-1}{3} \\neq \\frac{1}{4} \\quad \\text{(fails)}\\]\" width=\"188\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>- Add 2 to denominator:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/f/acf03d810983b6e5d2454824f7462e1542ebadb2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2}{3+2} = \\frac{2}{5} \\neq \\frac{1}{2} \\quad \\text{(fails)}\\]\" width=\"174\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>→ Does not satisfy both conditions.\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 4: Check option (D) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f4344e4ce1c2a266b885d9b160544e3036de15f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>- Subtract 3 from numerator:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8fa3c510f7ab2a879ef1bc798c54f59149dc31fa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{5-3}{8} = \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{1}{4} \\quad \\text{(works)}\\]\" width=\"187\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>- Add 2 to denominator:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/2/02231cd842904418b3fa55ecd0fca65c5ecbface.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{5}{8+2} = \\frac{5}{10} = \\frac{1}{2} \\quad \\text{(works)}\\]\" width=\"196\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>→ Satisfies both conditions.\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Answer:**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/61544e558ccea6e325da3e0cef5321e1998900e0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{\\frac{5}{8}}\\]\" width=\"24\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=~Trashboycan\" title=\"~Trashboycan\">~Trashboycan</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_35\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 35\"> Problem 35</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_37\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 37\">Problem 37</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041644\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 148/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 661/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 305/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4566/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.489      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    6.489      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20681:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041644 and revision id 280617. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}